</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 915)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Check for Updates sees a release the moment it is out.</b> The update feed was served from a cache that could be up to five minutes old, so a check made just after a release said "up to date". Every check now fetches fresh.</li>
<li><b>The PDF manual, second pass.</b> Shortcut keys set in SF Mono; each chapter opens with an "In this chapter" list with page numbers; figures numbered per chapter (Fig. 2.3); table headings as quiet labels; contents and index entries that wrap keep their page number on the last line; the cover carries the edition month; a colophon closes the book.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
